Virtual Internship Platform for Students

1. Title

Virtual Internship Platform for Students.

2. Domain

Education Technology (EdTech) / Internship Management System

3. Who is the User?

1. Student

Register and log in

Create and update profile

Search and apply for internships

View application status

2. Company (Employer)

Register and log in

Post internship opportunities

View student applications

Accept or reject applications

3. Admin

Manage students and companies

Approve company accounts

Manage internship postings

Monitor platform activities

4. What Problem Are We Solving?

Many students struggle to find internship opportunities because information is scattered across multiple websites and social media platforms. Companies also find it difficult to manage internship applications efficiently. This platform provides a single online system where students can search and apply for internships, while companies can post opportunities and manage applications. For example, a third-year engineering student can easily log in, upload a resume, apply for internships, and track the application status from one dashboard.

5. Proposed Solution

The application will provide a centralized platform for students, companies, and administrators.

Key Features:

Student registration and login

Company registration and login

Internship posting and management

Search internships by title or location

Online internship application

Resume upload

Application status tracking

Admin dashboard for managing users and internships

