8. Success Criteria

A student should be able to register within 2 minutes.

Students should be able to search and apply for an internship in under 1 minute.

Companies should be able to post a new internship in less than 2 minutes.

Admin should be able to manage users and internships through a single dashboard.

The system should securely store and retrieve user information.

9. Out of Scope

The following features will not be included in this project:

Online interview or video conferencing

Real-time chat between students and companies

AI-based internship recommendations

Online internship certificate generation

Payment gateway integration

Mobile (Android/iOS) application

Email/SMS notification service

